  "findings": [
    "HAW7 keeps the exact Jacquet modulus and q^{-j(j-1)/2} partial-product normalization, all j including n and rank1. The generalized-character quotient shares the needed scalar relations even if its functional annihilates the initial vector.",
    "HAW8 transports the same nonzero vector through local isotypy; the inverse finite part and lowVal normalization match literal OrdScalAlt.",
    "HAW9 was corrected during this review: its projector now selects unit-norm generalized eigenvalues of the original normalized z operator, rather than all nonzero eigenvalues. The corrected polynomial preserves every actual part and proves the exact OrdAt spanning assertion.",
