    "HAW11 transfers the actual IsJ weight map and same supplied rho using semisimple comparison, without requiring its continuity; its ExpOf output has all local components.",
    "HAW12 ordered spectral-idempotent calculation is correct: E_a left and E_b right leave nonzero scalar factors for a>=b and identify exact diagonal characters. Arithmetic separation via (1+ell)^e works in the specified algebraic closure.",
    "HAW13 descends the given irreducible rho through V.pr using trace pairing, then converts the literal Kills polynomial-law relation through the T coefficient to the ordered matrix relation. No V0ok or continuity premise is added."
